# szal_engine_runner.tcyr — Engine (engine_runner.cyr) end-to-end tests.
#
# Ports the Engine integration tests from rust-old/src/engine/mod.rs (the #[cfg(test)] module):
# mode dispatch (sequential/parallel/dag/hierarchical), retry success/exhaustion, transitive DAG
# failure, rollback success/failure, fail-fast sequential, invalid-flow rejection, cancellation
# (pre-cancel / partial / uncancelled), event-sink ordering + rollback events, execution-store
# persistence (and the run_with_cancellation no-persist + queue-path Running-only divergences), and
# distributed dispatch (+ non-Dag rejection).
#   cyrius build --strict --no-deps tests/szal_engine_runner.tcyr build/test_engine_runner && ./build/test_engine_runner

